    "body": "<div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"col-inner\">\n            \n                  <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-12\">\n                      <div class=\"col-inner\">\n                        DietSensor is a revolutionary nutrition coaching app\n                        designed to help users take control of their health\n                        through science-backed, personalized nutrition\n                        programs.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        Associated with DietSensor Inc., the app was created by\n                        Astrid and Remy Bonnasse, whose family story inspired\n                        its mission. DietSensor empowers individuals to make\n                        better dietary choices for lasting wellness and disease\n                        prevention.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        With more than 37 fully customized programs, DietSensor\n                        provides tailored guidance for goals such as:\n                        <ul>\n                          <li>Weight loss</li>\n                          <li>Muscle gain</li>\n                          <li>Intermittent fasting</li>\n                          <li>Ketogenic diets</li>\n                          <li>Diabetes management</li>\n                          <li>Cardiovascular health</li>\n                        </ul>\n\n                        <br />\n                        Users can access 36 weekly meal plans, 600 healthy\n                        recipes, and smart shopping lists, all adapted to their\n                        preferences, health profiles, and goals.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        The app also helps users analyze meals through voice\n                        input or barcode scanning, identify unbalanced eating\n                        habits, and receive real-time nutritional insights\n                        powered by a large food database. Integration with Apple\n                        Health and Google Fit supports seamless activity\n                        tracking and hydration monitoring.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        Named a CES Best of Innovation Award Honoree,\n                        DietSensor combines technology, science, and compassion\n                        to make expert nutrition guidance more accessible.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        Website:\n                        <a href=\"https://dietsensor.com/\" target=\"_blank\"\n                          >https://dietsensor.com/</a\n                        >\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        Download the app on the App Store or Google Play to\n                        start building smarter, healthier eating habits.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        \n                        <div style=\"background: #1e293b; color: #f8fafc; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 5px solid #3b82f6; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 20px;\">\n                          <i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\" style=\"margin-right: 10px; color: #60a5fa;\"></i>\n                          If you need a demo access account, please contact me on my email <a href=\"mailto:contact@farhaan.info\" style=\"color: #60a5fa; text-decoration: underline;\">contact@farhaan.info</a>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>"
