    "desc": "NexStock — a multi-store inventory & business management platform: products, stock adjustments, inter-store transfers, POS, quotations, invoicing, suppliers, reporting and audit logs. Laravel modular monolith API, React + TypeScript SPA and a Flutter companion app.",
