    "desc": "Lokal — a local business directory that gives small businesses a professional digital profile: searchable listings, product catalogues, WhatsApp / phone / e-mail contact, a 7-step seller onboarding wizard and an admin CRM. Built with React 19, TypeScript, Vite and Supabase.",
    "keywords": "lokal, business directory, local business, small business, seller portal, onboarding wizard, admin crm, react, typescript, vite, supabase, row level security, tanstack query, i18next, mauritius",
